{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14215040","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14215040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1421504001:1":{"text":"ここで何かの大会が？あなたがチャンピオンなんですか？すごい！","source_cn":"这里是举办了什么比赛吗？你是比赛的冠军？好厉害！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01A9BE33A1436373","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421504002:2":{"text":"それ、噓だよ！今年の鍛魂大会は、エントリーが始まったばかりだし！","source_cn":"别听他吹了！今年的锻魂大赛还没办呢！报名才刚刚开始！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89E1CAA715810457","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421504003:1":{"text":"でも、俺の実力なら優勝も夢じゃない！しかも、今回は師匠が出てきて指導してくれるんだ！あの人、昔はもうちょっとで優勝だったんだぞ！","source_cn":"以我的实力拿冠军又不是不可能！而且这次我好不容易请了我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA550BB1B716BA3D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421504004:1":{"text":"君の師匠も相当なホラ吹きだからな、本当に当てになるのか？でも、そうだな、私も師匠に一声かけて、アドバイスしてもらおう。","source_cn":"你师父那点手艺有多少是自己的你不清楚？你倒提醒了我，报...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD0E649C423361EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421504005:1":{"text":"じゃあこっちは、師匠の師匠、もっと上の師匠まで全員呼び出してやる！","source_cn":"那我就把我师父的师父、师父的师父的师父都请过来！我就不信……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C0DBB5493D391CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421504006:1":{"text":"えっと……この大会って、他の人に手伝ってもらっていいんですか？","source_cn":"这是什么比赛呀，怎么还能让别人帮忙的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08B4E138E9331F79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421504007:1":{"text":"分かってないな。私たちドワーフは「技術の継承」をすごく大事にしててね。職人になるには、まず師匠について学ぶんだ。","source_cn":"这你就不懂了吧，我们矮人最重视的就是技艺的传承，在成为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B2CA6CA6E15D294","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421504008:1":{"text":"作業する時も、問題が起きたらすぐに師匠と一緒に考える。技術ってのは、閉じこもってちゃ上達しないんだ。","source_cn":"干活的时候，遇到什么难题也是第一时间和师父一起研究，毕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71BA421530C64701","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421504009:1":{"text":"つまり、鍛魂大会ってのは職人だけじゃなくて、その師匠の指導力も試されるってこと。弟子が優勝すれば、師匠の顔も立つってもんだよ！","source_cn":"说白了，锻魂大赛考验的不光是工匠，还有工匠师父的指导水...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1850ED5062DAA61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421504010:1":{"text":"そういえば、ヴェインはどうするんだ？あいつ、ずっと一人じゃないか。","source_cn":"说到这个，你觉得瓦恩该怎么办？他可一直是一个人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x788A3C780DF6BECE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421504011:1":{"text":"大会に出る気なのか？恥を晒すことになるだけなのに。","source_cn":"瓦恩？他还想着参赛呢！回家玩木头锤子吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EF47E2B94D7D950","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421504012:1":{"text":"ヴェインって人、ちょっと浮いてるみたいですね……","source_cn":"这个瓦恩……你们不是很看好他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40A5456E2995178E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1421504013:1":{"text":"あいつは、村でも有名な<style=\"highlight\">出来損ないの職人</style>でさ……","source_cn":"他可是我们村有名的<style=highlight>造...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A01805E85DBB395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421504014:1":{"text":"まずい、ヴェインがこっちに来る！おい、さっさとエントリーしに行くぜ！","source_cn":"不说了不说了，我看到瓦恩走过来了！走，报名去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC68319C5B41318AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1421504015:1":{"text":"鍛魂大会かぁ……なんだか面白そうね！","source_cn":"锻魂大赛……听起来很有意思！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x925AE2DA61D2251A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_ti